    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it really getting weaker? I can't tell from the appearance at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch out for the lava! Just how much obsidian has this thing absorbed?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "GROOOAAAAARRRRR!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Giant Originium Slug"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_145_prove_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor thing... But we can't afford to show it any mercy! Skyfire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, I got it! Time to go all out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well then, how do you like the taste of this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
