    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "We did it! It's heading the other way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#3",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes! The citizens are going to be safe now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good grief! I can't believe a single slug would be that hard to deal with! My skirt is all ruined...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the leader of the colony after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "If people didn't destroy their habitat in the first place, then perhaps...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm exhausted! Let's not bring up that tiresome topic again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, me too. I'm so tired I can barely stand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we have to head back to Siesta. There are people waiting for us there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 4,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oof!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's understandable, but a mature lady should also learn to get help if she's not even able to keep her balance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-thank you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceylon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, let's go take our victory lap now. Once we get back, there might still be some time for us to enjoy our vacation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But... sooner or later, this place will...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Big tail?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I'm coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skyfire...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Provence"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
        "name2": "char_145_prove_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we should respect the city's choice, and let them handle the rest, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skyfire"
    },
